{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an epic underwater world, where you'll start as a small fish and embark on an exciting survival journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, feed and grow into super-sized sea creatures as you explore an amazing underwater playground, all while evolving and gaining new abilities along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as your fishy friend transforms and evolves into more powerful forms with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Fish Survivor and swim, munch, evolve, and gain new abilities on your way to becoming the coolest fish in the sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time for an underwater adventure like no other!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2603110?t=1766564897","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2603110?t=1766564897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603110/042260ab8e6089313eabfd332d435b80703b6b58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766564897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603110/042260ab8e6089313eabfd332d435b80703b6b58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766564897","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an epic underwater world, where you'll start as a small fish and embark on an exciting survival journey.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, feed and grow into super-sized sea creatures as you explore an amazing underwater playgrou